  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2024-25 PACIFICWIN 09/08/24 V022 CANBERRA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NIU Pacific Training will bring together 35 Pacific peoples from their respective countries to be further training in CLIMATE MOBILITY; and in particular, the impact climate migration and the value of the GLOBAL COMPACT FOR SAFE, ORDERLY AND REGULAR MIGRATION in assisting our population groups towards climate mobility solutions. The key issues covered in the training will include: climate mobility in COP; disaster and risk management; climate displacement; in-situ adaptation; relocation; loss and damages; climate finance; and any other issue identified by the Pacific Participants.</narrative>
  </description>
